        "event_id": "lite_evt_00070",
        "explanation": "Doctor explicitly tells family the patient cannot go home and must be evaluated by a thoracic surgeon, giving concrete escalation criteria.",
        "quote": "不能再回家观察…必须尽快由胸外科医生评估是否需要住院或手术。以下是关键判断标准，您可以告诉家人："
      }
    ],
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
        "explanation": "Doctor correctly identifies the urgency of the presentation and links it to the need for CT and in‑person evaluation.",
        "quote": "目前最关键的是尽快完成胸部CT检查，以评估肺部复张情况、是否有持续气漏或积气范围扩大。"
      }
    ],
    "continuity_memory_focus": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00086",
