        "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
        "explanation": "Doctor identifies the current presentation as time‑sensitive, requiring urgent evaluation.",
        "quote": "您弟弟目前的症状提示右气胸可能复发，且伴有明显的胸痛、肩背放射痛和持续气短，这属于需要尽快明确评估的急症情况。"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00159",
        "explanation": "Doctor uses plain language to address family fear of anesthesia and surgery, confirming that the plan is about urgent evaluation, not forcing surgery.",
        "quote": "现场胸外科已经确认右侧气胸还在，又是复发还合并肺大泡，所以不是在家观察能解决的，拖着反而怕突然加重；胸腔镜是为了处理肺大泡、降低再复发"
      }
    ]
  },
